<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/"><channel><title>道德经 · 每日一章</title><link>https://zj-gu.github.io/x3-feed/</link><description>《道德经》每日一章：每天零点从八十一章中随机撷取一章，竖排大字，常读常新。</description><language>zh-cn</language><item><title>今日一章 · 第7章</title><description><![CDATA[<img src="https://zj-gu.github.io/x3-feed/wallpapers/ddj_07.jpg"/><p>天长地久。天地所以能长且久者，以其不自生，故能长生。是以圣人后其身而身先；外其身而身存。非以其无私邪，故能成其私。</p>]]></description><enclosure url="https://zj-gu.github.io/x3-feed/wallpapers/ddj_07.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><media:content url="https://zj-gu.github.io/x3-feed/wallpapers/ddj_07.jpg" type="image/jpeg" medium="image"/><link>https://zj-gu.github.io/x3-feed/wallpapers/ddj_07.jpg</link><guid isPermaLink="false">ddj-7-20261128</guid><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 08:00:29 +0800</pubDate></item></channel></rss>